      "id": "claim_3442c677840b4c9995bbec24d963d8d4",
      "statement": "policy_check selects the policy by loan type rather than searching for it, scopes deterministic calculation tools from CHECK_TOOLS_POOL according to policy metadata, passes the application plus bank-statement end dates and today's date to the agent, and persists the structured policy result together with harvested tool calls under policy_check/result.json.",
