      "id": "claim_d7331ec8f4b242d2b6ea6391cf492150",
      "statement": "companies_house is the workflow’s branching point: it runs a structured Companies House lookup with CompaniesHouse___* tools and geo-target___CheckSameArea, applies a runtime groundedness check to the found claim, redacts street-level address details from persisted tool-call evidence, writes companies_house/result.json, and routes to financial_assessment only when found remains true.",
